BEGIN

1. Create a graph with nodes A to J.
2. Define the available colors.
3. FUNCTION COLOR(node):
      IF all nodes are colored:
          RETURN TRUE

      FOR each color:
          IF no adjacent node has this color:
              Assign the color to the node.

              IF COLOR(next node) is TRUE:
                  RETURN TRUE

              Remove the assigned color.

      RETURN FALSE

4. Call COLOR(first node).
5. Display the color of each node.

END
